{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/2881d5db9f30ce1fe1909edbe2b3c288.avif?t=1756450751\" width=685 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Fiery City, where dreams glow and shadows whisper, Juliet lives a quiet, well-ordered life. She is thoughtful, principled, and untouched by the games others play. But something has changed. A presence has entered her life. It is charming, dangerous, and impossible to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It is the story of a woman standing at the edge of temptation, asked to make choices that challenge everything she thought she believed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world around her grows more uncertain, Juliet is offered paths she never imagined. Some are beautiful. Some are dark. All are hers to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739070?t=1756450751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/351c6bd7525f498b4e6d84f2e0cc689928382f70/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756450751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/629dc8a75a525e3b3171c569973488433cd793d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756450751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/629dc8a75a525e3b3171c569973488433cd793d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756450751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes and adult-oriented content, including depictions of intimacy, relationship te